WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.776 --> 00:00:13.741
*paper shredder*

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.203
What's going on in here?

00:00:19.203 --> 00:00:20.153
Light switch

00:00:22.976 --> 00:00:24.154
Oh, Texas. It's just you.

00:00:25.245 --> 00:00:26.248
What are you doing in here?

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:28.136
Nothing.

00:00:28.136 --> 00:00:29.597
*nervous laughter of remembering weight room training routine of Arkansas offensive linemen* 

00:00:29.597 --> 00:00:32.911
Well since you're here, let me show you something I think you're really gonna like.

00:00:33.352 --> 00:00:34.204
Oh I can grab that for you.

00:00:34.645 --> 00:00:35.892
Ah I'll hold on to it.

00:00:38.983 --> 00:00:43.270
Check this out. Goodbye divisions. Hello pod scheduling.

00:00:43.270 --> 00:00:45.527
Here's an example of what your pod could look like.

00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:47.234
Texas.

00:00:47.916 --> 00:00:48.814
Oklahoma.

00:00:49.474 --> 00:00:50.425
Texas A&amp;M

00:00:50.893 --> 00:00:52.043
and Arkansas.

00:00:54.193 --> 00:00:56.193
So we'll just never win a football game ever again?

00:00:56.266 --> 00:00:57.041
What's that?

00:00:57.041 --> 00:00:57.541
Huh?

00:00:57.541 --> 00:00:58.490
OH.

00:00:58.490 --> 00:01:00.249
We are just so excited

00:01:00.249 --> 00:01:03.106
to have the opportunity to play in such a prestigious league.

00:01:03.778 --> 00:01:05.548
....are the words...I said.

00:01:06.702 --> 00:01:08.627
and listen...you didn't hear this from me

00:01:08.627 --> 00:01:14.520
We're real close to negotiating an early buyout with the Big 12 so y'all could be apart of the SEC as early as next season

00:01:14.520 --> 00:01:18.779
Weeelll you know a contracts a contract. You're only as good as your word.

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:26.625
Besides.....we sure wouldn’t want to miss a chance to face off against our classic Big 12 rivals Cincinnati and BYU in conference play in 2025.

00:01:27.787 --> 00:01:29.787
Now tell me you don't want that SEC money rolling in.

00:01:30.354 --> 00:01:33.281
Yeah we could be the richest non-bowl eligible team in the country!

00:01:34.152 --> 00:01:41.208
I do appreciate the offer but after giving it some more thought, I've decided to stick it out with my Big 12...

00:01:42.163 --> 00:01:45.481
*horror sounds of remembering that four separate Arkansas players scored easy rushing touchdowns*

00:01:48.813 --> 00:01:49.848
That's strange.

00:01:50.336 --> 00:01:52.997
We have a legally binding signed letter of acceptance.

00:01:53.857 --> 00:01:58.000
Riigghhhttt but like I said. We were a little hasty..

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:02.418
*door lock sounds of hearing Sam Ehlinger "We're back!" soundbite every time they play Texas highlights in a Buffalo Wild Wings*

00:02:04.308 --> 00:02:09.309
I mean it's a great conference. Lots of history...but I think for us..

00:02:10.096 --> 00:02:11.494
You don't seem to understand.

00:02:13.029 --> 00:02:14.651
I'm not locked in here with you.

00:02:16.117 --> 00:02:18.117
You're locked in here with me.

00:02:18.498 --> 00:02:20.844
*horror sounds of realizing this is all universal karma for Bevo going after Uga*

